{"study_accession":"PRJNA1227212","secondary_study_accession":"SRP565794","title":"Conjugated bile acids polarize hepatic CD4 lymphocytes involving the S1PR-STAT3-FOXP3 axis in models of fibrosing cholangiopathies.","description":"CD4 lymphocytes control epithelial injury in inflammatory conditions. We show that upregulation of genes associated with regulatory T cells responses at the time of diagnosis of biliary atresia are associated with better outcomes following surgical drainage procedure. Using single cell genomics and functional assays we reveal the mechanisms by which conjugated bile acids determine polarization and suppressor functions of CD4 lymphocytes. Reduction of hepatic bile acid concentration with IBAT inhibitor in experimental sclerosing cholangitis leads to a surge of hepatic Tregs mediating hepatoprotective effects of this anticholestatic therapy.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN46975422","study_accession":"PRJNA1227212","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-09-01","attributes":[["isolate","HIA76"],["age","0.18"],["biomaterial_provider","Alexander Miethke"],["collection_date","2019-06-29"],["geo_loc_name","USA"],["sex","male"],["tissue","PBMCs"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR32459648","experiment_accession":"SRX27774041","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiScanSQ","read_count":39400801,"base_count":1990574630,"first_public":"2026-09-01","experiment_title":"Illumina HiScanSQ sequencing: RNA-Seq of CD4"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":true},{"sample_accession":"SAMN46975423","study_accession":"PRJNA1227212","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"female","geo_sample":"","access":"open",